# .gitignore for a separate campaign-data repo (see "Saving Campaigns" in the
# dnd-dm:new-campaign skill). The repo holds campaigns/ and events/, symlinked
# into the project's D&D data dir.

# party/ holds the secret player-link tokens, QR codes and live feed
# (committing them would publish working join credentials); voice_registry.yaml
# is regenerated per session; the per-campaign rulebook cache is regenerable.
campaigns/*/party/
campaigns/*/voice_registry.yaml
campaigns/*/rulebooks/cache/
rulebook_cache/
.DS_Store
